    "Content": "<div><div><p><span><span>T</span><span>he new Power BI connector for </span><span>vCore</span><span>-based Azure Cosmos DB for Mongo</span><span>DB</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>simplifies </span><span>integration</span><span>.</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>You can now </span><span>connect Power BI </span><span>and&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>vCore</span><span>-based Azure Cosmos DB for MongoDB</span><span>&nbsp;using </span><span>DirectQuery</span><span>&nbsp;mode, allowing you to query your live data.</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><br></p></div><div><p><span></span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/mongodbvcore-powerbi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.</span></span></p></div><br></div>",
